1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:09,008
Five profiles share an LCX miss on 9 of 242 development records.

2
00:00:09,008 --> 00:00:17,616
Agreement between models does not establish correctness.

3
00:00:17,616 --> 00:00:26,224
Follow the error through the working evidence loop.

4
00:00:26,924 --> 00:00:36,136
UCI411-020 was selected from an outcome-aware development audit.

5
00:00:36,136 --> 00:00:45,349
Fold 2 excluded: fitting, calibration and threshold selection.

6
00:00:45,349 --> 00:00:54,561
Case, target, profile and provenance stay connected.

7
00:00:55,261 --> 00:01:03,822
LCX: 22.2% estimate; 33.0% fitted research threshold.

8
00:01:03,822 --> 00:01:12,384
Recorded LCX positive: the prediction misses it.

9
00:01:12,384 --> 00:01:20,945
Generic anatomy identifies the vessel; it does not locate a lesion.

10
00:01:20,945 --> 00:01:29,506
Grouped SHAP reconstructs model log odds; associations are not causes.

11
00:01:30,206 --> 00:01:38,773
Five profiles: separately fitted; training-fold calibration where selected.

12
00:01:38,773 --> 00:01:47,339
All five miss UCI411-020’s recorded LCX positive.

13
00:01:47,339 --> 00:01:55,906
Different record UCI411-128: Age 62 → 63; LAD 44.4% → 45.4%.

14
00:01:55,906 --> 00:02:04,472
The original outcome comparison is disabled for edited input.

15
00:02:05,172 --> 00:02:14,341
61-record frozen final test; development audit is a separate scope.

16
00:02:14,341 --> 00:02:23,510
CAD 0.908 · LAD 0.893 · LCX 0.748 · RCA 0.724 ROC-AUC.

17
00:02:23,510 --> 00:02:32,680
Frozen thresholds retain false positives and false negatives.

18
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:41,849
Small single cohort; external and clinical validity remain unestablished.

19
00:02:42,549 --> 00:02:51,654
Portable source + model weights + split + report + third-party attributions.

20
00:02:51,654 --> 00:03:00,759
20 Python tests · 52 Node tests · 17 case transitions · 64 journey paths.

21
00:03:00,759 --> 00:03:09,864
Two actual delayed-failure browser checks protect current case ownership.

22
00:03:09,864 --> 00:03:18,969
Local CPU inference; software verification is not clinical validation.

23
00:03:19,669 --> 00:03:27,863
Audit → excluded case → named artery → explanation → recorded error.

24
00:03:27,863 --> 00:03:36,056
Python · scikit-learn · SHAP · Three.js · BodyParts3D.

25
00:03:36,056 --> 00:03:44,249
AI assistance: OpenAI Codex. Narration: local Kokoro af_heart.

26
00:03:44,249 --> 00:03:52,442
Educational research only; source evidence and reproduction instructions included.
